{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-research","title":"科学研究方法","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"科学研究方法-简介\">科学研究方法 简介</h1><p>科学研究方法是自然科学博士训练的方法论基石。它不仅关乎&quot;如何做实验&quot;，更关乎&quot;如何设计可靠的知识生产流程&quot;——从假设提出到实验设计，从数据采集到统计推断，从结果解释到成果发表，每一个环节都有严格的方法论规范和常见的认知陷阱。掌握这些方法论，是博士研究者从&quot;执行导师的实验方案&quot;进阶为&quot;独立设计研究&quot;的核心能力。</p>\n<p>本知识库聚焦三个对当代科学研究至关重要的方法论前沿。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>实验设计</strong>系统讲解随机化、对照与盲法的原理，阶乘设计和自适应设计的应用场景，以及统计功效分析和样本量计算——这些是确保实验结论具有内部效度和外部效度的基础工具。实验设计的核心问题是：如何在有限资源下最大化信息产出，同时最小化系统性偏差。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>计算方法</strong>覆盖分子模拟、蒙特卡洛方法和科学计算工作流——当代自然科学研究越来越依赖计算作为&quot;第三范式&quot;（与理论和实验并列），博士研究者需要理解计算方法的原理、适用范围和局限性，即使他们的主要工作不是编写代码。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>可重复性</strong>直面当代科学面临的最严峻方法论危机——大量已发表研究无法被独立重复验证。本章分析可重复性危机的根源（统计滥用、发表偏倚、数据管理不善），介绍预注册和注册报告等制度创新，以及开放科学实践如何从根本上改变科学知识的生产和验证方式。</p>\n<p>建议学习路径：从实验设计入手建立方法论直觉，然后学习计算方法拓展工具箱，最后通过可重复性章节反思整个科学知识生产体系的制度设计。三章共同构成一个完整的&quot;研究方法论意识&quot;——不仅知道怎么做研究，更知道怎么做可靠的研究。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"experimental-design","title":"实验设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/experimental-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"randomization-controls-and-blinding","title":"随机化、对照与盲法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/experimental-design/randomization-controls-and-blinding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"factorial-and-adaptive-designs","title":"阶乘设计与自适应设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/experimental-design/factorial-and-adaptive-designs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"power-analysis-and-sample-size","title":"统计功效分析与样本量计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/experimental-design/power-analysis-and-sample-size"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"computational-methods","title":"计算方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/computational-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"molecular-simulation-methods","title":"分子模拟方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/computational-methods/molecular-simulation-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monte-carlo-and-stochastic-methods","title":"蒙特卡洛与随机方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/computational-methods/monte-carlo-and-stochastic-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scientific-computing-workflows","title":"博士阶段 科学研究方法 — 科学计算工作流与可重复计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/computational-methods/scientific-computing-workflows"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"reproducibility","title":"可重复性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/reproducibility","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"replication-crisis-and-root-causes","title":"博士阶段 科学研究方法 — 可重复性危机与根源分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/reproducibility/replication-crisis-and-root-causes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"preregistration-and-registered-reports","title":"博士阶段 科学研究方法 — 预注册与注册报告制度","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/reproducibility/preregistration-and-registered-reports"},{"seq":3,"slug":"open-science-and-data-sharing","title":"博士阶段 科学研究方法 — 开放科学与数据共享","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/scientific-research/reproducibility/open-science-and-data-sharing"}]}]}